# W7b, guest b (k2).
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@100
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log b joined a
follow 40 until epoch>=@200
wander -150 -60 20 until stage=stagml11,control fail epoch>=@275
log b home after the grace
idle until frames>=120 fail key:4=1
